=\u00a0\u00bbon|10px|10px|10px|10px\u00a0\u00bb border_width_all=\u00a0\u00bb2px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#BABA82&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Valoriser ses engagements gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un label reconnu, audit\u00e9 et sectoriel.<\/li>\n<li>Disposer de preuves solides et cr\u00e9dibles (tra\u00e7abilit\u00e9, indicateurs, suivi).<\/li>\n<li>Anticiper les attentes r\u00e9glementaires (CSRD, ODD\u2026) et celles des clients.<\/li>\n<li>Faire entendre la voix des producteurs engag\u00e9s.<\/li>\n<li>Acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des d\u00e9bouch\u00e9s durables et valorisants, en phase avec les nouvelles exigences des march\u00e9s.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][et_pb_toggle title=\u00a0\u00bbS\u2019appuyer sur un collectif et \u00eatre repr\u00e9sent\u00e9\u00a0\u00bb open_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#BABA82&Prime; open_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; closed_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#BABA82&Prime; toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3b;||divi||400&Prime; use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#baba82&Prime; open_toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3a;||divi||400&Prime; open_use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb title_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#BABA82&Prime; title_level=\u00a0\u00bbh4&Prime; title_font=\u00a0\u00bb|800|||||||\u00a0\u00bb body_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#574121&Prime; body_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb18px\u00a0\u00bb body_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.6em\u00a0\u00bb border_radii=\u00a0\u00bbon|10px|10px|10px|10px\u00a0\u00bb border_width_all=\u00a0\u00bb2px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#BABA82&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>B\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d\u2019une communaut\u00e9 engag\u00e9e et outill\u00e9e, fond\u00e9e sur le partage et la coop\u00e9ration.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\u00a0\u00bb1_2&Prime; _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb][et_pb_text _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb header_2_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"p1\">B\u00e9n\u00e9fices \u00e9motionnels<\/h3>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_toggle title=\u00a0\u00bbFaire partie d\u2019un collectif humain et solidaire\u00a0\u00bb open_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; open_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; closed_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; closed_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3b;||divi||400&Prime; use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#baba82&Prime; open_toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3a;||divi||400&Prime; open_use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb title_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; title_level=\u00a0\u00bbh4&Prime; title_font=\u00a0\u00bb|800|||||||\u00a0\u00bb body_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#574121&Prime; body_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb18px\u00a0\u00bb body_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.6em\u00a0\u00bb border_radii=\u00a0\u00bbon|10px|10px|10px|10px\u00a0\u00bb border_width_all=\u00a0\u00bb2px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ne pas (plus) \u00eatre seul face \u00e0 la transition.<\/li>\n<li>S\u2019entourer de personnes qui partagent les m\u00eames d\u00e9fis.<\/li>\n<li>Partager les m\u00eames convictions avec d\u2019autres producteurs engag\u00e9s.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][et_pb_toggle title=\u00a0\u00bbRetrouver (ou garder ?) du sens et de la fiert\u00e9 dans son m\u00e9tier\u00a0\u00bb open_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; open_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; closed_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; closed_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3b;||divi||400&Prime; use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#baba82&Prime; open_toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3a;||divi||400&Prime; open_use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb title_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; title_level=\u00a0\u00bbh4&Prime; title_font=\u00a0\u00bb|800|||||||\u00a0\u00bb body_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#574121&Prime; body_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb18px\u00a0\u00bb body_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.6em\u00a0\u00bb border_radii=\u00a0\u00bbon|10px|10px|10px|10px\u00a0\u00bb border_width_all=\u00a0\u00bb2px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maintenir ou retrouver du sens dans son activit\u00e9.<\/li>\n<li>Renforcer la fiert\u00e9 dans son m\u00e9tier.<\/li>\n<li>Se sentir soutenu et reconnu pour ce que l\u2019on fait d\u00e9j\u00e0.<\/li>\n<li>\n\u00catre reconnu par ses pairs, ses clients, ses partenaires.\n<\/li>\n<li>\nAvancer avec plus de clart\u00e9 et de confiance dans un contexte incertain.\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][et_pb_toggle title=\u00a0\u00bbContribuer activement \u00e0 un changement positif\u00a0\u00bb open_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; open_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; closed_toggle_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; closed_toggle_background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3b;||divi||400&Prime; use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_color=\u00a0\u00bb#baba82&Prime; open_toggle_icon=\u00a0\u00bb&#x3a;||divi||400&Prime; open_use_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bbon\u00a0\u00bb open_icon_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb30px\u00a0\u00bb _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb title_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; title_level=\u00a0\u00bbh4&Prime; title_font=\u00a0\u00bb|800|||||||\u00a0\u00bb body_text_color=\u00a0\u00bb#574121&Prime; body_font_size=\u00a0\u00bb18px\u00a0\u00bb body_line_height=\u00a0\u00bb1.6em\u00a0\u00bb border_radii=\u00a0\u00bbon|10px|10px|10px|10px\u00a0\u00bb border_width_all=\u00a0\u00bb2px\u00a0\u00bb border_color_all=\u00a0\u00bb#275F61&Prime; global_colors_info=\u00a0\u00bb{}\u00a0\u00bb]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u00catre acteur du changement, \u00e0 son \u00e9chelle, sans pression.<\/li>\n<li>Contribuer \u00e0 une agriculture qui respecte les hommes, les territoires et le vivant.<\/li>\n<li>Participer \u00e0 une fili\u00e8re qui d\u00e9fend les vraies valeurs du m\u00e9tier agricole.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\u00a0\u00bb1&Prime; _builder_version=\u00a0\u00bb4.27.5&Prime; _module_preset=\u00a0\u00bbdefault\u00a0\u00bb background_color=\u00a0\u00bb#F7F3E5&Prime; background_image=\u00a0\u00bbhttps:\/\/www.demainlaterre.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/separateur-trait-beige2.svg\u00a0\u00bb background_size=\u00a0\u00bbcustom\u00a0\u00bb background_image_width=\u00a0\u00bb100%\u00a0\u00bb min_height=\u00a0\u00bb90px\u00a0\u00bb min_height_tablet=\u00a0\u00bb90px\u00a0\u00bb min_height_phone=\u00a0\u00bb20px\u00a0\u00bb min_height_last_edited=\u00a0\u00bbon|phone\u00a0\u00bb height=\u00a0\u00bb90px\u00a0\u00bb height_tablet=